{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"Cato was so distracted by there conversation he forgot his dessert. He begins to eat.","created_at":"2020-07-31T05:29:42.778000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-31T05:29:50.730000Z","id":"738629445077696603","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"“That’s only the tiniest fraction. Then, the middle ring: the elemental planes. We have water, fire, air, and earth. Each is the source of its element, with deserts and seas of flames in the Fire Plane, an endless sky and clouds in the Air Plane, et cetera. They all hang in the Elemental Chaos, a plane of pure elemental energy.”","created_at":"2020-07-31T05:31:04.757000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738629788922675202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"And what plane are we?\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T05:31:40.882000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738629940442038324","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
